{"unit_id":"BOWLUNA__dsh-custom-mode#card-zh","repo":"BOWLUNA/dsh-custom-mode","commit":"51fb996bc0cf23cc8ee9d69c4e39137894caa768","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-custom-mode 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的助手与自定义模式管理插件，在设置页提供多个助手的管理界面，并通过专用 API 路由读写助手状态。用户可以编辑系统提示词、选择基础模式、调整各个插件开关、查看提示词历史，也可以创建、删除、排序和修复助手；保存时会校验提示词变量并处理外部修改冲突。助手内容保存在本机 preset 文件中，创建时可选 Coding、Writing 或 Chat 起始设置。适合需要为不同任务维护独立 DSH 助手、并在新会话中切换模式的用户。需要已安装并配置好的 DSH；插件不负责安装宿主或设置模型凭据。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:7-23","index.mjs:168-185","client.js:4-34","seed.mjs:31-38"]}
{"unit_id":"BOWLUNA__dsh-custom-mode#card-en","repo":"BOWLUNA/dsh-custom-mode","commit":"51fb996bc0cf23cc8ee9d69c4e39137894caa768","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-custom-mode manages DSH Web assistants. Edit prompts, base modes and plugin switches, create or reorder assistants, review prompt history, and save locally with variable checks and conflict detection. A configured DSH host is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:7-23","index.mjs:168-185","client.js:4-34","seed.mjs:31-38"]}
