{"unit_id":"BOWLUNA__dsh-custom-mode#feature-1","repo":"BOWLUNA/dsh-custom-mode","commit":"51fb996bc0cf23cc8ee9d69c4e39137894caa768","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-custom-mode 的功能「编辑助手模式」：在设置页读取并保存助手的系统提示词、基础模式和插件开关；保存时检查提示词变量并检测文件版本冲突。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.mjs:8-12","index.mjs:168-185","index.mjs:406-434"]}
