{"unit_id":"BOWLUNA__dsh-custom-mode#caveat-1","repo":"BOWLUNA/dsh-custom-mode","commit":"51fb996bc0cf23cc8ee9d69c4e39137894caa768","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-custom-mode 使用前须知：编辑器中的未保存草稿只保存在当前浏览器文档内，重载或关闭页面可能丢失；保存后的助手配置写入本机 preset 文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:20-23","seed.mjs:17-21","index.mjs:10-12"]}
